<title>USA: U.S. stockpile corrects date of next vanadium sale.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile corrects date of next vanadium sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said its next vanadium pentoxide offering has been delayed because of the Christmas holiday.</p>
<p>The offering's new date is January 9, 1997 at 1000 EST instead of December 26, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
